+-- S3b T2: the statement's (0_K, 1_K) reach `gather`. A BARE out-of-range read pads with 0_K, an Iverson
+-- factor is 1_K / 0_K, and an out-of-range read UNDER a `.unaryFn` pads with the real 0.0 whatever the
